# Regression tripwire for CI, scored against the shipped sample corpus - the
# only corpus a clean checkout has. Twelve questions on twelve plainly
# distinct papers, so retrieval should find them easily and any drop means
# something broke rather than that the questions were hard.
#
# This is NOT a quality measurement and its mrr is not a claim about the
# system. The honest numbers come from evals/retrieval.jsonl over the full
# corpus and from evals/heldout.jsonl, which was frozen before it was scored.
# This file exists to fail a build.
